族就彻底的败了……“蓝雅……！”看着染上火苗的资料，男子恼怒了，抬脚上前。“告诉你，这部车上装满了**，既然走不了，就让我们同归于尽吧。”轻飘飘的声音响起，那手中燃烧的资料袋，朝着迷彩车上一扔。‘轰’巨大的火苗烧起，就好似整个车上浇满了石油一般。上空所有人都瞪大眼睛，大声叫喊着，启动快飞……蓝雅抬头，她知道飞机上坐着的是什么人，所以，这一次谁都别想逃，过了今天都会结束，一切都会结束……‘轰轰’大火燃烧了几秒之后冲天的爆破声，彻响整个天际，就连上空的直升飞机都被冲击下来，爆炸……慕辰国。夜色弥漫，月光柔美，散落在湖面上，波光粼粼，风如娑，月如钩。湖面上荡漾着优美的声音，那乐声轻飘飘的，竟能让人的心中升起一抹波动。花船之上，一男子斜躺在软榻之上，黑色长发，未绾未系披散在身后，光滑顺垂如同上好的丝缎，无由便起了一缕勾魂摄魄的醉酒风流。一双勾魂摄魄的眼眸紧紧的闭着，更增添撩人风情。唇瓣轻抿，似笑非笑，肌肤白皙胜雪，似微微散发着银白莹光一般。男子的对面，一绿意女子正在抚琴，听来正是刚刚那蛊惑人心之声‘铮’最后一个音调，一曲划上句号。女子睁开闭起的眼睛，带着几分羞涩的看着那软榻之上的男子，然而稍稍起身，移步到男子身侧。“王爷。”女子轻声唤道，小手已经附在男子的胸口之处，轻轻摩擦……软榻上的妖娆男子，缓缓睁开眼睛，那是一双入大海一般的深蓝眼眸，带着人们无法想象的冰冷，在那眼底的最深处沉浮。“你应该知道本王的性格如何。”轻轻的声音，听不出任何的喜怒，深蓝色的眼眸再次闭上。那附在男子胸口的小手一顿，绿衣女子脸上登时变得苍白，慌忙的收回小手，惊恐的跪在地上，身形瑟瑟发抖。“王爷饶命，奴婢知错了。”颤抖的嗓音，足以证明她对面前的男子有多恐惧。当今狂王，冰冷嗜血，是她一时间忘记了规矩……男子缓缓地泯了下酒杯里的美酒，仍旧地合着眼：“再有下次，自己了结。”那磁性的声音，说如此八个字，虽然说的很轻很轻，但足以让下方的女人浑身一颤。寂静的湖面之上琴声消去，一抹诡异的气息悄然无息的划开，香味弥漫，散发着诱人的气息。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/shenyiqifei/3.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Traveling through time and space \"My identity was imposed on me by you. In the past thirteen years, you have deprived me of everything. Now it is time to repay.\" The woman's right hand moved little by little, and the flames burned on the information bag. For thirteen years, she has endured torture that ordinary people cannot bear, and has been used as a guinea pig for drug trials. For thirteen years, she has been imagining all the time that at this moment, all the identity certificates and virus research of the Silver Moon family are here. There are no copies, and the relevant information has been destroyed by her long ago. The most important thing of the entire Yinyue family was burned down, and the Yinyue family was completely defeated... \"Lanya...!\" Looking at the information stained with flames, the man became angry and stepped forward. \"Let me tell you, this car is full of **. Since we can't leave, let us die together.\" A light voice sounded, and the burning information bag in his hand was thrown towards the camouflage car. \"Boom!\" A huge flame broke out, as if the entire car was filled with oil. Everyone in the sky widened their eyes, shouted loudly, and started to fly...Lanya looked up. She knew who was sitting on the plane, so no one could escape this time. It would be over after today, everything would be over...'Boom' After the fire burned for a few seconds, the sound of explosions soared into the sky, resounding throughout the sky. Even the helicopter above was impacted and exploded...Mu Chenguo. The night is full, the moonlight is soft and scattered on the lake, the waves are sparkling, the wind is like a breeze, and the moon is like a hook. Beautiful sounds are rippling on the lake. The music is so light that it can make people feel a wave of emotion. On the flower boat, a man was lying on a soft couch. His long black hair, untied and untied, was hanging loosely behind him. It was as smooth and smooth as fine silk satin. He could not help but feel a sultry drunken streak. A pair of seductive eyes were tightly closed, adding to the sultry charm. The lips were pursed slightly, half-smiling, and the skin was whiter than snow, as if it was slightly emitting a silvery white light. Opposite the man, a green woman was playing the piano, and what she heard was the last note of the enchanting sound just now, 'Zheng', which brought the song to an end. The woman opened her closed eyes and looked at the man on the soft couch with a bit of shyness. Then she stood up slightly and moved to the man's side. \"Your Majesty,\" the woman called softly, her little hand already attached to the man's chest, rubbing it gently... The enchanting man on the soft couch slowly opened his eyes. It was a pair of deep blue eyes that were as deep as the sea, with an unimaginable coldness, floating in the deepest part of his eyes. \"You should know what my character is like.\" There was no emotion or anger in the soft voice, and the dark blue eyes closed again. The little hand attached to the man's chest paused, and the woman in green suddenly turned pale. She hurriedly withdrew her little hand and knelt on the ground in fear, trembling. \"Your Majesty, please spare my life, I know I was wrong.\" The trembling voice was enough to prove how scared she was of the man in front of her. Today's mad king is cold and bloodthirsty, but she forgot the rules for a moment... The man slowly drank the wine in the glass, still closing his eyes: \"Next time, I will end it myself.\" That magnetic voice said these eight words, although it was very soft, it was enough to make the woman below tremble. The sound of the piano disappeared on the silent lake, and a strange breath spread quietly, the fragrance was filled with an alluring scent.", "title_en": "Chapter 3"}